~ start
Eve: ...
You suddenly feel very self conscious about your small stature standing in front of the large batwinged lady.
As she gazes at you coldly you can't help feeling incredibly judged.
Eve: You have arrived...
- You knew I was coming?
    do WorldDialogueManager.MarkBossInteracted()
    Eve: I know everything. 
	Eve: ...
	Eve: Let us battle. 
    do WorldDialogueManager.StartBossBattle()
    => END
- No actually, I just got lost. Bye!
    do WorldDialogueManager.MarkBossInteracted()
    Eve: ...
    do WorldDialogueManager.EndDialogue()
    => END
	
~ BackForMore
Eve: You have returned.
- Yes
    do WorldDialogueManager.MarkBossInteracted()
    do WorldDialogueManager.StartBossBattle()
	 => END
- No no, I just got lost again. Oopsie!
    do WorldDialogueManager.MarkBossInteracted()
	Eve: Oh...
    do WorldDialogueManager.EndDialogue()
    => END
	
~ PostBattle
Eve: You have done well.
You hear a click and a rumbling in the distance as if a path has opened.
Eve: This is for you.
"You received [color=yellow]Eve[/color]'s card."
do WorldDialogueManager.EndDialogue()
=> END